From 4540ac906c32a42c50967da1c9ecce841d762907 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 16:59:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Revenue accuracy and admin panels: Revenue & Sales, System
 Health, Analytics range

Migration c3e5a7b9d1f2: enrollments record the amount actually paid, currency, source and an
estimate flag (old rows backfilled and marked estimated; rows with no Stripe receipt are
"unverified" and count as $0 until corrected). Bundle charges are split so parts equal the
Stripe charge. Stripe webhook bundle unlock is idempotent per session.

Overview, Analytics and the new Revenue & Sales panel use recorded amounts instead of list
price x enrollments. Revenue & Sales: summary, monthly chart, filters, pagination, server CSV,
correct-a-row. Grants can record a real payment. /api/enroll records free enrollments.

System Health: real configuration checks (Stripe mode vs environment, webhook, email, cron,
postal address), migration status, release, real uptime, items needing attention; header
database status is real. Analytics: date range, started/completion columns, certificates and
subscriber metrics. Clear Test Data needs typed confirmation.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01URtjpUpUbYyjhc8gMGou4L
